    "https://careers.uh.edu/jobs/assistant-associate-professor-educational-leadership-houston-texas-united-states": {
      "title": "Assistant/Associate Professor, Educational Leadership",
      "description": "Assistant/Associate Professor, Educational Leadership - Houston, Texas, United States Assistant/Associate Professor, Educational Leadership - Houston, Texas, United States Kiosk mode Assistant/Associate Professor, Educational Leadership 496920 Full-Time Leadership & Policy Analysis Department : Transformative Leadership, Counseling, and Innovation Salary : Commensurate with Experience/Education Description : The College of Education at the University of Houston-Clear Lake invites applications for a nine-month, tenure-track Assistant Professor of Educational Leadership position in the Department of Transformative Leadership, Counseling, and Innovation, with an anticipated start date of August 2027. We seek a scholar with significant PreK-12 district or central office leadership experience who is committed to preparing the next generation of educational leaders. The successful candidate will contribute to the Ed.D. in Educational Leadership and M.S. in Educational Leadership and Administration programs through teaching, research, dissertation supervision, and service. Candidates should demonstrate the ability to work collaboratively and collegially with faculty, staff, students, school and district partners, and other community stakeholders. The Department of Transformative Leadership, Counseling, and Innovation is a thriving academic unit within the College of Education. The department offers graduate programs in Educational Leadership, Clinical Mental Health Counseling, School Counseling, Instructional Design and Technology, and School Library Science. Department faculty are committed to excellence in teaching, scholarship, and service while preparing scholar-practitioners to address complex challenges in educational and organizational settings. The department fosters a collaborative environment that values innovation, leadership development, professional practice, and meaningful educational impact. Duties Maintaining an active and productive research agenda that contributes to the field of educational leadership Teaching graduate courses in Educational Leadership and related areas Supporting doctoral and master's students through advising, mentoring, and dissertation supervision Participating in service activities that support the department, college, university, profession, and broader educational community Collaborating with faculty, staff, school districts, and educational organizations to strengthen academic programs and partnerships Contributing to program development, accreditation, assessment, and continuous improvement efforts within Educational Leadership Qualifications Required: Earned doctorate in Educational Administration, Educational Leadership, or a closely related field. Evidence of strong scholarly record in educational leadership. Significant K-12 central office and/or district-level leadership experience. Strong expertise in quantitative, qualitative, and/or mixed methods research. Ability to connect research and scholarship to authentic problems of practice facing educational leaders, schools, and districts. Evidence of effective teaching at the graduate level or strong potential for excellence in graduate instruction. Preferred: Experience in both K-12 district leadership PLUS higher education leadership roles. Experience mentoring and supporting doctoral students through the dissertation process. Record of successful grant activity, funded research, or other externally supported projects. Experience teaching and mentoring Ed.D. and/or Ph.D. students. Demonstrated ability to build partnerships with school districts, educational organizations, and community stakeholders. Required Attachments by Candidate: 1) Curriculum Vitae, 2) a Letter of Application that addresses the required and preferred qualifications, and highlights teaching philosophy and experience, 3) unofficial graduate transcripts, 4) copies of educator certifications, and 5) three letters of reference Note: Please combine all supporting documents into one file for attachment to your application. Official transcripts will be requested for the finalists who are invited for on-campus interviews, and a background check will be required. This position is not eligible for H-1B sponsorship. For any questions on this posting, please contact FacultyAffairs@uhcl.edu . All positions at the University of Houston-System are security sensitive and will require a criminal history check. The University of Houston System and its universities are Equal Opportunity Institutions. Everyone is encouraged to apply. Apply now First Name (required) aa3d9e61 Last Name (required) b4b45218 Email (required) e0a7d568 Cell number f22ae38d 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61) Austria (+43) Azerbaijan (+994) Bahamas (+1) Bahrain (+973) Bangladesh (+880) Barbados (+1) Belarus (+375) Belgium (+32) Belize (+501) Benin (+229) Bermuda (+1) Bhutan (+975) Bolivia (+591) Bosnia & Herzegovina (+387) Botswana (+267) Brazil (+55) British Indian Ocean Territory (+246) British Virgin Islands (+1) Brunei (+673) Bulgaria (+359) Burkina Faso (+226) Burundi (+257) Cambodia (+855) Cameroon (+237) Canada (+1) Cape Verde (+238) Caribbean Netherlands (+599) Cayman Islands (+1) Central African Republic (+236) Chad (+235) Chile (+56) China (+86) Christmas Island (+61) Cocos (Keeling) Islands (+61) Colombia (+57) Comoros (+269) Congo - Brazzaville (+242) Congo - Kinshasa (+243) Cook Islands (+682) Costa Rica (+506) Côte d’Ivoire (+225) Croatia (+385) Cuba (+53) Curaçao (+599) Cyprus (+357) Czechia (+420) Denmark (+45) Djibouti (+253) Dominica (+1) Dominican Republic (+1) Ecuador (+593) Egypt (+20) El Salvador (+503) Equatorial Guinea (+240) Eritrea (+291) Estonia (+372) Eswatini (+268) Ethiopia (+251) Fal