      "title": "Lecturer, Computer Information Systems",
      "description": "Lecturer, Computer Information Systems - Houston, Texas, United States Lecturer, Computer Information Systems - Houston, Texas, United States Kiosk mode Lecturer, Computer Information Systems 497313 Full-Time Computing Sciences Department : Computing Sciences Salary : Commensurate with Experience/Education Description : The Computer Information Systems (CIS) Program in the College of Science and Engineering at the University of Houston–Clear Lake (UHCL) invites applications for a full-time Lecturer position. The anticipated starting date is August 2027. Note: Applications received by January 15, 2027 will receive full consideration. Duties: Develop and teach undergraduate CIS courses, with opportunities to teach graduate courses based on academic qualifications Provide undergraduate student advising and support student success Provide service to the program, college, university, and profession Qualifications Required: Master's Degree in Computer Information Systems, Information Systems, or a closely related field by the time the position starts Candidates must demonstrate a strong commitment to undergraduate teaching Preferred: Ph.D. in Computer Information Systems, Information Systems, or a closely related field Qualifications to teach both undergraduate and graduate CIS courses Demonstrated teaching experience in data analytics, database systems, systems analysis and design, cybersecurity, or related areas Required Attachments by Candidate: 1) Curriculum Vitae, 2) a Letter of Application that addresses the required and preferred qualifications, and highlights teaching philosophy and experience, 3) unofficial graduate transcripts Note: Please combine all supporting documents into one file for attachment to your application. Official transcripts will be requested for the finalists who are invited for on-campus interviews, and a background check will be required. This position is not eligible for H-1B sponsorship. For any questions on this posti